      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED TAPE (1) box seated before sticking on well to finish 4.5 lengths away in third (23.16) at this track in a Mix 1/2/3 over 400m. Boasts two wins from four starts out of this box. Likely to feature again. HELLO CHEVY (2) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this trip which boasts three wins and four placings. In the money last time at Gosford (22.24) in a NG, finishing a 2.25 lengths third. Can feature in the finish. HUXLEY'S ROCKET (8) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 22.74 beating RHAPSODY BEAST. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. One of the key runners again. ZIPPING OSAKA (4) was in the money last start in fast time and should feature again.",
